      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bc63165b150d502fa6164e3|full_name}: Despite that, there are plenty of people that like using VRChat for NSFW purposes such as myself. While the rooms are private and only an NSFW community can enter, it doesn't stop many avatars from getting torn down for NSFW content, which restricts the NSFW community. That sucks, because there are NSFW people that use NSFW avatars responsibly, and there are trolls and horny teenagers that use NSFW content IRresponsibly, and it's the latter causing these avatars to get taken down.\nI want an NSFW flag on avatars so instead of getting taken down, they simply can't be used in a public room where anyone can join.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
