      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They could easily require an ID attached to your account in order to gain access to them. It’s not necessarily for nsfw activities, there’s plenty of users who just don’t like kids and want to just be with adults. It would create a safe space for adults to be adults and not have to worry about kids seeing or hearing things that they shouldn’t. I know the developers are against this but just because they don’t like a community doesn’t mean they will go away. Just build the space for it, put protections in with consequences & hire a team to oversee it, people are paying money to the developers now so it’s not like they are strapping for cash.",
